WEBVTT

00:00:08.068 --> 00:00:11.366
Every synthesizer has a
sound in it that's yours.

00:00:12.066 --> 00:00:17.216
Finding it means knowing your circuit:
which modules to wire together, where the

00:00:17.216 --> 00:00:20.563
feedback goes, and how each
choice shapes the sound.

00:00:22.763 --> 00:00:26.491
Auracle is a synthesizer
that searches for your sound.

00:00:27.991 --> 00:00:30.204
In EVOLVE, it plays you two sounds.

00:00:30.204 --> 00:00:32.291
You pick the one you like better.

00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:34.818
Every pick teaches it your taste,

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:37.366
and it grows new patches toward it.

00:00:37.866 --> 00:00:42.346
Not samples. Real modular circuits,
built and wired from scratch.

00:00:43.746 --> 00:00:45.663
Then you play it, in PERFORM.

00:00:46.563 --> 00:00:50.178
Turn Bright, and it finds the knobs
that make this patch brighter.

00:00:56.994 --> 00:01:00.579
Let it wander, and the knobs turn
themselves toward your taste.

00:01:12.146 --> 00:01:16.086
Press Offer, and a new version
grows from the sound in your hands.

00:01:16.786 --> 00:01:19.020
Blend into it. Take it, or pass.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:20.556
Either way, it learns.

00:01:30.245 --> 00:01:32.644
Open the sound in PATCH any time.

00:01:32.644 --> 00:01:36.715
Every knob is real, and you
can watch PERFORM turn them.

00:01:37.415 --> 00:01:42.711
Underneath, a model of your taste bets on
every choice before you make it, and keeps

00:01:42.711 --> 00:01:43.720
score in public.

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:47.758
Every note in this film is Auracle.

00:01:48.758 --> 00:01:51.810
Free, open source, and
running in your browser.

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:54.318
Play it today.
